Error: Jet.ProgramEntryMixed: Top-level statements at `program_entry_mixed_package.jet:3` and `run: fn` at `words.jet:4` are two entries of one program
  --> Tests/UI/ProgramEntryMixed/program_entry_mixed_package.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | print(greeting())
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A program is script style, its entry file's top-level statements, or one `run: fn`, never both, so it starts in one place
 Fix: Move the statements into `run: fn`, or remove `run: fn` so the statements run
